SUMMARY:HOPERA presents Opera Karaoke!
DESCRIPTION:Our FREE Season Kickoff Party at Eureka Heights 7pm-close. \nWe’re kicking things off the only way we know how—with another unforgettable Opera Karaoke\, where everyone is invited to grab a mic\, sing along\, and toast the start of a brand-new season. !
